---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Summer Camp" description="Summer camp, PA day and March break programs at Junior Hub.">
    <section id="banner">
      <h2>
        <b><span style="color: white; font-size: 125">Summer Camp</span></b>
      </h2>
      <p>
        4 - 6 years old <br />
        July - September
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Main -->
    <section id="main" class="container">
      <section class="box special">
        <p>
          Junior Hub is pleased to offer a summer camp program for the
          children aged 4 to 6, July to September.
          <a href="/summercampregister">Register Here!</a>
          <br />
          <br />
          Children will enjoy numerous fun and educational indoor and outdoor
          games and activities that are great for summer. They will also
          explore the world of STEAM with hands-on Science, Technology,
          Engineering, Art and Maths powered activities with our expert
          educators.
        </p>
        <h3>Summer Camp Registration and Fees:</h3>
        <table>
          <tr>
            <th>Item</th>
            <th>Price</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Weekly 9:00am - 5:00pm</td>
            <td>$322</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Extension Care 8:00am - 6:00pm</td>
            <td>+$40</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Meal Plan Option (hot lunch and 2 snacks)</td>
            <td>+$30</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <h3>Important Dates:</h3>
        <p>
          Registration is required for a minimum of 2 weeks. Registration
          date: <u>February 1</u>.
          <br />
          Camp will be closed on August 1st for the civic holiday (no charge
          on this day).
        </p>
        <h3>Activities:</h3>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 1: Music Fun</h4>
            <ul
              style="
                list-style-image: url(/images/music.png);
                text-align: left;
              "
            >
              <li>Freeze dance</li>
              <li>Instruments party</li>
              <li>Musical chairs</li>
              <li>Cultural dances</li>
              <li>Hot potato</li>
              <li>Soft music with soft props</li>
              <li>Follow the rhythm</li>
              <li>Movement songs</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 2: Down on the Farm</h4>
            <ul
              style="list-style-image: url(/images/cow.png); text-align: left"
            >
              <li>Petting zoo</li>
              <li>Planting seeds</li>
              <li>Making playdoh</li>
              <li>Fruit crafts</li>
              <li>Animal sounds</li>
              <li>Animal race</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 3: Adventureland</h4>
            <ul
              style="list-style-image: url(/images/ship.png); text-align: left"
            >
              <li>Treasure hunt</li>
              <li>Pirate hats</li>
              <li>Costume day</li>
              <li>Reading and create a map</li>
              <li>Digging for treasures</li>
              <li>Building a boat</li>
              <li>Sailing race</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 4: It's a Small World</h4>
            <ul
              style="
                list-style-image: url(/images/globe.png);
                text-align: left;
              "
            >
              <li>Puppet show</li>
              <li>Costume of diverse cultures</li>
              <li>Costume day</li>
              <li>Reading and create a map</li>
              <li>Digging for treasures</li>
              <li>Building a boat</li>
              <li>Sailing race</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 5: Imaginarium</h4>
            <ul
              style="list-style-image: url(/images/gear.png); text-align: left"
            >
              <li>Building ice castles</li>
              <li>Marshmallow architecture</li>
              <li>Fingerprint art</li>
              <li>“Big” inventors</li>
              <li>Creative Junk</li>
              <li>Free art with assorted items</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 6: Under the Stars</h4>
            <ul
              style="list-style-image: url(/images/star.png); text-align: left"
            >
              <li>Glow in the dark play</li>
              <li>Camping dramatic play</li>
              <li>Picnic table</li>
              <li>Homemade s'mores and more</li>
              <li>Fishing</li>
              <li>Shadow puppets</li>
              <li>Observing with magnifying glasses</li>
              <li>Observing and reading about insects and worms</li>
              <li>Collecting and sorting out leaves</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 7: Water fun</h4>
            <ul
              style="
                list-style-image: url(/images/dolphin.png);
                text-align: left;
              "
            >
              <li>Water splash day</li>
              <li>Float or sink experiment</li>
              <li>Bubbles in water</li>
              <li>Build my own aquarium</li>
              <li>Ice play</li>
              <li>Five Little Ducks dramatic play</li>
              <li>Sensory bin activity</li>
              <li>Muddy animal dramatic play</li>
              <li>Color mixing water play</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 8: "Crazy" Science</h4>
            <ul
              style="
                list-style-image: url(/images/science.png);
                text-align: left;
              "
            >
              <li>Raiinbow volcano</li>
              <li>Mixing colors experiment</li>
              <li>Lava lamp experiment</li>
              <li>Magic milk science experiment</li>
              <li>Explore with magnets</li>
              <li>Clouds and rain experiment</li>
              <li>Light and shade activity</li>
              <li>Mobius ring</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-12-mobilep">
            <h4>Week 9: The Wild World of Sport</h4>
            <ul
              style="
                list-style-image: url(/images/medal.png);
                text-align: left;
              "
            >
              <li>Animal race</li>
              <li>Medals and more</li>
              <li>Crab walk</li>
              <li>Simon says</li>
              <li>Animal stretches</li>
              <li>Relay race</li>
              <li>Sprints</li>
              <li>Pop bubbles</li>
              <li>Balancing games</li>
              <li>Hopscotch</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Literacy and Math Learning Boosts!</h3>
        <p>Each week, children will:</p>
        <ul style="text-align: left">
          <li>Engage in a literacy boost that connects to each theme</li>
          <li>
            Engage in math games to enhance their understanding of math
            concepts
          </li>
          <li>
            Explore topics of interest within or beyond the weekly theme, and
            engage in hands-on collaborative projects and challenges
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </section>
</Layout>
